{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo"><img src="/images/2018/06/Cabinetry_Header-hero.webp" alt="All Wood Cabinets" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h1>All-Wood Mantra Cabinets</h1><h2>From Singer Kitchens with Showrooms in New Orleans &amp; Mandeville</h2><div class="el-text"><p>We know all too well how kitchen cabinets can either make or break the look of your kitchen. That’s why we only offer the best, most trusted brands to the New Orleans Metro area.</p><p>Singer Kitchens is proud to feature Mantra Cabinets as one of our offered brands for cabinetry. With budget-friendly pricing and some of the quickest shipping in the nation, Mantra stands out as one of our favorite brands. Let’s take a look at how Mantra cabinetry can completely transform your kitchen in next to no time at all.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Speed, Service, Quality: A Mantra To Build Buy</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Straightforward cabinet products with a single-minded focus on relevant styles and colors, while upholding our mantra of quality and service. Along with our core values, Mantra is ready for you Right Now.</p><p>In today’s fast-paced, budget-conscious environment, an excellent cabinetry manufacturer needs to offer quality products with all the upgrades built-in, reliable service that exceeds expectations, and quick shipping to meet the tightest of deadlines. You can trust that Mantra will deliver because they are backed by the largest and most trusted cabinet company in the U.S. – MasterBrand Cabinets®.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>A New Kitchen In Next To No Time</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Mantra’s delivery lead times are among the fastest in the industry. When you simply can’t wait for a new kitchen, Mantra always strives to deliver their products quickly and completely. Their “quick ship” line offers quality cabinetry with upgrades already included, saving time and money.</p><p>New shipments arrive in a cycle ship calendar, typically with just 15 business days between order and arrival. </p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Affordable Without Sacrificing Quality</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Your dream kitchen doesn’t have to cost an arm and a leg! For the more budget-conscious renovation, Mantra offers excellent quality cabinets for a more than reasonable price.</p><p>Every Mantra cabinet is designed with popular features already included, such as all-plywood construction, dovetail drawers, roll-outs, and soft-close doors and drawers. There are no add-on fees and no need to negotiate to get the extras you want.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Simple, Straightforward Styles For Every Home</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Mantra’s specialization is in straightforward cabinet products, with a single-minded focus on relevant styles and colors, all while upholding their mantra of quality and service.</p><p>They offer three sleek, elegant styles that would fit in perfectly with any home: Classic, Omni, and Spectra. Each comes in a variety of neutral colors and finishes that will elegantly elevate any room.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>A Simple, Straightforward Cabinet That Looks And Performs Great</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Want to see what others are saying about Mantra? Here are just a few reviews from former customers:</p></div><hr class="el-divider"><p class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p><div class="el-text"><h4>Solid cabinet &amp; budget friendly</h4><p><em>As a kitchen designer, I appreciate a simple &amp; straight-forward cabinet that looks &amp; performs great. It's important to me that all of my clients get a quality product.</em></p></div><p class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p><div class="el-text"><h3>Great Product</h3><p><em>As a vendor and installer, we use Mantra for our clients who are on a budget. The turn-around is great and the construction is above average for its price range. We have installed everything from kitchens and bathrooms, to offices and laundry rooms. We do recommend this product since we have had such great results.</em></p></div><p class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</p><div class="el-text"><h4>Wonderful Cabinetry</h4><p><em>Mantra is a great cabinet line. The finish is better than any competitor, their lead time is great, and they have all the most popular sizes.</em></p></div><hr class="el-divider"></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ready For A Kitchen Remodel?</h2><div class="el-text"><p>Ready to give your kitchen a sleek, practical upgrade? We’re ready to make it happen.</p><p>Call us today in New Orleans or Mandevbille to see the Mantra Cabinet line or for a free consultation or to get a free estimate on your remodeling, and we’ll be ready to give you a whole new kitchen in next to no time.</p></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
